<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Belgian OLO exchange auction 750 mln bfr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belgian OLO exchange auction 750 mln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its</p>
<p>linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 750</p>
<p>million Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount of new OLOs sold (in bfr)</p>
<p> code 287 4.00% (2000)	 none</p>
<p> code 285 5.00% (2001)	 750 million *</p>
<p> code 265 7.75% (2004)	 none</p>
<p> code 286 6.25% (2007)	 none</p>
<p> code 287 4.00% (2000)	 none</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 750 million bfr of OLO 8 (code 254) 9.25 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
